Rem ===================================================================
Rem mungo-caverns-objects.shoddy -- what lies in it. Hand-edited source.
Rem First written by a generator from adventure.yaml; both are in
Rem obsolete/ now and neither is run. The recorded transcripts are the
Rem specification.
Rem
Rem 70 objects, in declaration order, NO_OBJECT first.
Rem Places holds one location index, or two for the objects that
Rem exist in two rooms at once (the grate, the troll, the chasm).
Rem The core models that second placement as a placement, not as
Rem index arithmetic on the object number.
Rem ===================================================================

Type Obj
    Tag       As String
    Inventory As String
    Words     As List Of String
    Places    As List Of Number
    Fixed     As Boolean
    Treasure  As Boolean
    States    As List Of Number
    Descs     As List Of String
    Changes   As List Of String
    Sounds    As List Of String
    Texts     As List Of String

Def Objects() As List Of Obj
    {
      Rem 0  NO_OBJECT  
      Obj("NO_OBJECT", "",
          { },
          { }, False, False,
          { },
          { },
          { },
          { },
          { }),

